# Production deploy

When the user asks to deploy to production (프로덕션 배포, deploy prod, ship live), use Vercel:

```bash
npx vercel --prod --yes
```

Do not default to Netlify. Use Netlify only if the user names Netlify explicitly.

`vercel.json` has `git.deploymentEnabled: false`, so a git push does not publish to Vercel. CLI deploy is required.
